#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.ge:1 of
msgid "Element-wise greater-than-or-equal comparison."
msgstr "按元素进行大于或等于比较。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.ge:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``>=`` operator (``__ge__``), so ``lf >= other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.ge(other)`` for non-LiteFrame ``other``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``>=`` 运算符（``__ge__``），因此对于非LiteFrame的 ``other``，``lf"
" >= other`` 等价于 ``lf.ge(other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.ge of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.ge:6 of
