msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.ge:9 of
msgid "Lazy boolean LiteFrame indicating where elements are >= ``other``."
msgstr "惰性布尔LiteFrame，指示元素在何处 >= ``other``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.ge of
msgid "返回类型"
